# Prettier runs from the repository root, so without this file `pnpm format`
# reaches into everything that lives here — including the vendored Schedjuice
# trees, which have their own tooling and their own formatting conventions.
# Rewriting 3,000 of their files would bury every real change in whitespace.
#
# One of those files (a YAML spec in schedjuice-reimagined-be) also fails to
# parse, which made `pnpm format:check` exit non-zero before it ever reported
# anything about Scholis.

# Vendored sibling projects — not part of the Scholis workspace
schedjuice-reimagined-fe/
schedjuice-reimagined-be/

# Generated: reformatting these only creates churn on the next regeneration
pnpm-lock.yaml
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
packages/db/migrations/meta/

# Build output and tooling caches
dist/
**/dist/
.next/
**/.next/
.turbo/
**/.turbo/
coverage/
**/coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Runtime artifacts
.storage/
**/.storage/

# Not text prettier should own
.env
.env.*
